description:
Soccer Dash is a casual soccer game where you play as the ball. Aim and control the soccer ball around obstacles and other players trying to obstruct you until the end. The game will go into a slow-motion state when you choose the direction of the kick, so take your time.

Features:
• Developing ingenuity and the right trajectory;
• Novel soccer game full of traps;
• Cool slow-motion effects;
• Fun and creative animations.
